OL,3,GNEWSABritain's Got Talent winner almost
OL,4,Amissed audition due to Carphone        
OL,5,AWarehouse shift                        
OL,7,FBritain's Got Talent winner Paul Potts 
OL,8,Fsaid he nearly missed his life-changing
OL,9,Faudition on the show because he had    
OL,10,Fbeen unable to get time off from his   
OL,11,Fjob managing a phone shop.             
OL,13,FThe tenor shot to fame in 2007 after   
OL,14,Fperforming Nessun Dorma on the ITV     
OL,15,Ftalent show, but had unsuccessfully    
OL,16,Ftried to change the date of his        
OL,17,Fperformance because of his shift at    
OL,18,FPort Talbot's Carphone Warehouse.      
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
