OL,3,GNEWSABritain's Got Talent winner almost
OL,4,Amissed audition due to Carphone        
OL,5,AWarehouse shift                        
OL,7,F"It was only thanks to a colleague who 
OL,8,Fnormally didn't work Saturdays that    
OL,9,Fcame into cover me ` otherwise I       
OL,10,Fwouldn't have been there," he said.    
OL,12,F"So thanks Allison."                   
